  "description": "Charts for .NET: the RioCharts engine, with no UI dependencies, behind the Blazor component, server-side PNG/SVG export and AI chart tools. It turns a serializable chart spec plus data into a render-agnostic scene. It includes scales, nice and calendar-aware time ticks, culture-aware label formatting, line/area/bar layout, LTTB downsampling and hit-testing.",
